# Terraform local state and cache - never commit real state, it can contain
# sensitive values in plaintext (and this project uses local state for now).
# .terraform.lock.hcl is NOT listed here - unlike the rest of this, that
# file should be committed (it's the equivalent of uv.lock, pinning exact
# provider versions/checksums for reproducible `terraform init` runs).
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/

# Variable files that might carry secrets/environment-specific overrides
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Terraform crash logs
crash.log
crash.*.log
